# V0 (plan.md step 12): read-only, opens no card. After the :latest move and before the placement.
# Read "=== fleet tag and platform image": zot.thatch.local:5000/thatch-serving-tt:latest and thatch-serving-tt:<TS7>
# must show the SAME image id and registry digest (the rig daemon's LOCAL :latest is what the agent runs; it does not
# pull). "=== node agent mesh shape": THATCH_TT_MESH_SHAPE=P150x4 on a process started after the drop-in merge
# (P300 or nothing: do NOT place). "=== serving containers" none (no thatch-inference-* and no qwen-c2-* copy left by
# the replay), the four-card set "no holders (tt-smi aside)", and "=== agent": no load attempts.
# C1 as in S1. Duration: 1-2 min.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-g1-C1
C2_PROFILE=general-prefix-tp4
# The thin layer by its immutable tag (TS7), printed beside :latest by the status step; nothing runs it here.
C2_PLATFORM_IMAGE=zot.thatch.local:5000/thatch-serving-tt:TS7
